 "notes": "MS-26 Bedrock geology of the Salem quadrangle (Hatcher and Acker, 1984). Legend age bracket 'Late Precambrian(?) - Ordovician(?)' spans the column and is not assigned to single units. Metamorphic zones: Blue Ridge kyanite; Brevard zone garnet (staurolite?) retrograded to chlorite; Chauga belt garnet (staurolite?); Inner Piedmont upper kyanite(?). Sections drawn with no vertical exaggeration, not itemized. Mines keyed to a text not in the packet. No drill holes. SUBSURFACE: none.",
